Package: km-init
Version: 0.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: mainline sm8850 build <root@localhost>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39)
Description: userspace keymaster TA bootstrap for SM8850 (iceland)
 Loads the stock keymaster TA into QTEE over the upstream qcomtee
 driver (libqcomtee object interface) and replays the boot-state
 notification ABL would have sent before jumping to the kernel:
 SET_ROT / SET_BOOT_STATE / SET_VBH (+ KEYMASTER_MILESTONE_CALL),
 reporting the byte-exact values of a locked, stock, GREEN boot
 (values in /etc/km-init/values.conf, generated by
 km-extract-values.py from the stock partition dumps). Holds the
 TA resident for later clients (e.g. Waydroid's keymint HAL).
